17:T627,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Do Pakistani students apply on Universitaly before the visa?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"For relevant higher-education study routes, applicants complete Universitaly pre-enrolment and the university validates it before the visa appointment process moves forward. Follow the exact university and Embassy instructions for your intake."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Universitaly validation guarantee an Italian student visa?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. It supports the visa process but does not guarantee approval. Admission, funding, pre-enrolment and the visa remain separate decisions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Should I pay an agent for an Italy visa appointment?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Follow only the appointment route published by the Italian Embassy or its authorised centre. The Embassy has warned applicants not to purchase appointments."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can a scholarship replace financial evidence?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not automatically. The current visa checklist determines which financial and sponsorship evidence is still required after a scholarship is considered."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What must I do after reaching Italy?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A non-EU student staying longer than three months generally applies for a study residence permit within eight working days and completes the university's final enrolment steps."}}]}1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"editorial-page editorial-page--guide","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/italy-student-visa-pakistan/\",\"name\":\"Italy student visa for Pakistani students: 2027 planning guide\",\"description\":\"P